[00:00.03]Main ab kyun hosh mein aata nahi?
[00:02.34]Sukoon yeh dil kyun paata nahi?
[00:04.57]Kyun todun khud se jo the waade?
[00:06.80]Ke ab yeh ishq nibhana nahi
[00:09.09]Main modun tumse jo yeh chehra
[00:11.31]Dobara nazar milana nahi
[00:13.70]Yeh duniya jaane mera dard
[00:15.97]Tujhe yeh nazar kyun aata nahi?
[00:18.15]Sohneya, yoon tera sharmana meri jaan na le-le
[00:22.89]Kaan ke peechhe zulf chupana, meri jaan, kya kehne!
[00:27.39]Zaalima, tauba tera nakhra! Iske waar kya kehne!
[00:32.04]Thaam ke baithe dil ko ghayal, kahin haar na baithein
[00:36.60]Teri nazrein mujhse kya kehti hain, inmein wafa behti hai
[00:42.06]Thodi-thodi si raazi, thodi si khafa rehti hain
[00:46.50]Log hain zaalim bade, inmein jafa dekhi hai
[00:51.28]Yeh duniya teri nahi, maine tujh mein haya dekhi hai
[00:55.50]Jeena muhaal mera tere bina
[00:59.35]Yeh saare nashe bekaar teri aankhon ke siva
[01:04.10]Ghar nahi jaata, main bahar, rehta tera intezaar
[01:08.72]Mere khwabon mein aa na karke 16 singhaar
[01:14.20]